graph TD
    Rules[custom_strategies.rules_json — legs / entry / expiry / exit] --> RS[RuleBasedStrategy]
    HandWritten[Hand-written strategies — strategies/registry.py, optional] --> BS
    RS --> |Inherits| BS[BaseStrategy]
    BS --> |Executes on| B{BaseBroker Interface}

    B --> |Live Trading| L[UpstoxBroker]
    L --> |Real API| E((NSE Exchange))

    B --> |Paper Trading| P[PaperBroker]
    P --> |Gets Live Data| L
    P --> |Saves Orders| DB[(MySQL: custom_strategy_positions)]

    B --> |Backtesting| M[MockBroker]
    M --> |Reads History| DF[BhavcopyDataFeed]
    DF --> |Reads| C[(dataset/fno_bhavcopy.db)]

    RS --> Greeks[utils/black76.py: Black-76 pricing/IV/Greeks]
    RS --> Payoff[utils/payoff.py: Max Profit/Loss, POP, breakevens]
